{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-4b5c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
        "name": "DemoApi - JWT",
        "description": "Collection for testing the Demo API with JWT authentication\nPort: 5100\nBase URL: http://localhost:5100/api/v1\n\n**Authentication Flow:**\n1. Execute the 'Generate JWT Token' endpoint to obtain the token\n2. The token will be automatically saved in the {{token}} variable\n3. Use the Products endpoints which already include the token automatically",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Authentication",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Generate JWT Token",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "exec": [
                                    "// Automatically saves the token in the environment variable",
                                    "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                                    "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.accessToken) {",
                                    "        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", jsonData.data.accessToken);",
                                    "        console.log(\"JWT token successfully saved!\");",
                                    "        console.log(\"Token expires at: \" + jsonData.data.expires);",
                                    "    }",
                                    "} else {",
                                    "    console.log(\"Error generating token: \" + pm.response.code);",
                                    "}"
                                ],
                                "type": "text/javascript"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "X-Security-Key",
                                "value": "{{securityKey}}",
                                "type": "text",
                                "description": "Security key for authentication"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "token"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Generates a JWT token for API authentication.\n\n**Required Headers:**\n- `X-Security-Key`: Security key configured in appsettings\n\n**Response 200 OK:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"tokenType\": \"Bearer\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 3600,\n    \"created\": \"2026-02-07T15:00:00Z\",\n    \"expires\": \"2026-02-07T16:00:00Z\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Response 401 Unauthorized:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"errors\": [\"Invalid security key. Authentication failed.\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** The post-request script automatically saves the token in the {{token}} variable."
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ],
            "description": "Endpoints for JWT authentication"
        },
        {
            "name": "Products",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get All Products",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "products"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Returns the list of all products registered in the system.\n\n**Authentication:** Bearer Token (JWT)\n\n**Response 200 OK:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Product Name\",\n      \"description\": \"Product Description\",\n      \"price\": 99.99,\n      \"active\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Response 401 Unauthorized:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"errors\": [\"Unauthorized\"]\n}\n```"
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get Product By ID",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/1",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "products",
                                "1"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Returns a specific product by ID.\n\n**Authentication:** Bearer Token (JWT)\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `id` (uint): Product ID\n\n**Response 200 OK:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"Product Name\",\n    \"description\": \"Product Description\",\n    \"price\": 99.99,\n    \"active\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Response 404 Not Found:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"errors\": [\"Product not found\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Response 401 Unauthorized:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"errors\": [\"Unauthorized\"]\n}\n```"
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Create Product",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
